GasRxn#1 H+CL+M<=>HCL+M (#G1)
GasRxn#2 BCL3+NH3<=>HCL+BCL2NH2 (#G2)
GasRxn#3 NH3+BCL2NH2<=>HCL+BCL(NH2)2 (#G3)
GasRxn#4 NH3+BCL(NH2)2<=>HCL+B(NH2)3 (#G4)
SurfRxn#1_Mat#1 NH3+E(S)=>N(S)+3H (#S1_Mat1)
SurfRxn#2_Mat#1 BCL3+N(S)=>BN(B)+E(S)+3CL (#S2_Mat1)
SurfRxn#3_Mat#1 BCL2NH2+E(S)=>2HCL+BN(B)+E(S) (#S3_Mat1)
SurfRxn#4_Mat#1 BCL2NH2+N(S)=>2HCL+BN(B)+N(S) (#S4_Mat1)
